# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
# Phase 4.4 (RFC 001 Option A): ``omniscribe_server.spec`` is the
# checked-in PyInstaller spec for the Windows server bundle. It MUST
# be tracked so the build is reproducible from a fresh clone. The
# blanket ``*.spec`` rule above is overridden for this one file.
*.spec
!omniscribe_server.spec
# Bundle reproducer (Sprint 1): proves the anyio bundling bug is
# local, not upstream. Tracked alongside the main spec so the next
# maintainer can re-run the minimal build if a regression hits.
!repro/minimal_anyio.spec

